Rather than attempting to build all of Qt's components, we deliberately focus
on a more minimal subset for easier compilation.

Sources are from:  https://download.qt.io/official_releases/qt/

Current version present:  6.12.0

Release archives (SHA-256):
  qtbase-everywhere-src-6.12.0.tar.xz
    a951bd163c7b80fc6b8c88d7668fb56abf91c152373e13c10666763238131307
  qtsvg-everywhere-src-6.12.0.tar.xz
    e4ab39534ec97987b1b9b60ef7f4d3253d5912a69f8c713a01753174a4029331

Archives are from the official Qt 6.12.0 submodules directory. Their
checksums match the corresponding files published by download.qt.io.
Integration and security patches are applied separately by bext.
